 "title": "Compatibilities of Weil equivariance",
 "statement": "All geometric- and scheme-Frobenius equivariance squares of\n[thm-pur-weil-equivariance-of-purity-and-trace] and of\n[prop-pur-weil-equivariance-scheme-frobenius] commute with finite\nreduction, scalar extension, composition, and base change.",
