 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "The compatibilities are those of the constituent purity, counit, and\ntrace statements established in\n[thm-pur-weil-equivariance-of-purity-and-trace] (each being\ncompatible with the coefficient transport of\n[thm-pur-adic-reconstruction]), transported by the scheme-Frobenius\nidentification of [prop-pur-weil-equivariance-scheme-frobenius].",
